WEBVTT

00:00:11.120 --> 00:00:12.880
(high-pitched humming)

00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:16.720
(tense music playing)

00:00:25.520 --> 00:00:26.880
(rumbling)

00:00:29.320 --> 00:00:31.080
(tense music continues)

00:00:44.240 --> 00:00:46.160
(dramatic music playing)

00:00:49.440 --> 00:00:50.400
(grunts)

00:01:03.320 --> 00:01:05.080
(dramatic music continues)

00:01:12.360 --> 00:01:13.560
(grunting)

00:01:15.040 --> 00:01:16.400
(both grunting)

00:01:22.200 --> 00:01:23.560
(pendant chimes softly)

00:01:25.760 --> 00:01:27.680
(heartbeat thudding)

00:01:41.080 --> 00:01:42.840
(rumbling in distance)

00:01:47.600 --> 00:01:48.960
(Dumbledore pants)

00:01:57.080 --> 00:01:58.840
(high-pitched humming)

00:02:02.360 --> 00:02:04.200
Who will love you now, Dumbledore?

00:02:07.120 --> 00:02:08.520
You're all alone.

00:02:10.920 --> 00:02:12.680
(crowd cheering)

00:02:16.080 --> 00:02:17.880
(all cheering)

00:02:27.480 --> 00:02:29.400
(soft music playing)

00:02:57.040 --> 00:02:58.880
I was never your enemy.

00:03:05.840 --> 00:03:08.520
Then, or now.

00:03:26.560 --> 00:03:28.480
(somber music playing)

00:03:47.720 --> 00:03:49.640
Did you ever think of me?

00:03:52.200 --> 00:03:53.400
Always.

00:04:00.480 --> 00:04:01.800
Come home.

00:04:09.840 --> 00:04:10.800
(grunts)

00:04:14.560 --> 00:04:16.480
(wistful music playing)

00:04:45.760 --> 00:04:46.720
(Qilin coos)

00:04:48.320 --> 00:04:50.640
-Here she is. -(trills)

00:04:51.600 --> 00:04:53.200
Well done, Bunty.

00:04:53.280 --> 00:04:54.640
(both chuckle)

00:04:57.000 --> 00:04:58.200
Come on, little one.

00:04:59.480 --> 00:05:02.040
I'm sorry. I must have
given you an awful fright.

00:05:02.120 --> 00:05:03.280
No, I think, um...

00:05:03.360 --> 00:05:07.280
sometimes it takes losing something
to realize quite how much it means.

00:05:10.120 --> 00:05:12.120
And sometimes you just...

00:05:15.520 --> 00:05:17.440
Sometimes you just know.

00:05:17.880 --> 00:05:18.920
(Qilin purrs)

00:05:27.400 --> 00:05:29.280
-(chitters) -Right, in you pop.

00:05:31.440 --> 00:05:33.400
Mr. Kowalski.

00:05:34.800 --> 00:05:36.600
I owe you an apology.

00:05:36.760 --> 00:05:41.040
It... It was never my intent for
you to suffer the Cruciatus curse.

00:05:42.040 --> 00:05:43.200
Yeah...

00:05:43.280 --> 00:05:45.560
well, you know, we got Queenie
back, so we're square.

00:05:45.640 --> 00:05:47.600
Hey, can I ask you a question?

00:05:48.520 --> 00:05:50.000
-Can I keep this? -(chuckles)

00:05:50.080 --> 00:05:51.680
For, like, old times' sake?

00:05:54.120 --> 00:05:57.600
I can't think of
anyone more deserving.

00:05:59.840 --> 00:06:01.400
Thanks, Professor.

00:06:01.480 --> 00:06:03.360
(wistful music playing)

00:06:13.840 --> 00:06:15.000
(Dumbledore sighs)

00:06:21.280 --> 00:06:22.320
Remarkable.

00:06:22.400 --> 00:06:23.200
But how?

00:06:23.280 --> 00:06:24.760
I thought you couldn't
move against one another.

00:06:24.840 --> 00:06:25.960
We didn't.

00:06:26.640 --> 00:06:29.360
He sought to kill, I
sought to protect.

00:06:29.440 --> 00:06:31.200
Our spells met.

00:06:32.680 --> 00:06:34.480
Let's call it fate.

00:06:35.800 --> 00:06:39.040
After all, how else will
we fulfill our destinies?

00:06:40.840 --> 00:06:42.040
(Theseus) Albus.

00:06:43.760 --> 00:06:45.280
Promise me.

00:06:47.480 --> 00:06:49.440
You'll find him and you'll stop
him.

00:06:54.640 --> 00:06:56.560
(wistful music continues)

